{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t星期一啟用的新皇崗口岸迎接第一個出入境高峰。不少市民趁重陽節長周末過關，亦有人是專程體驗新口岸，說會即日來回。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n有人稱讚新口岸設施，預計日後都會經皇崗往返香港與內地。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:59:25.738456+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T06:17:39.634876+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:57:35.853659+00:00","content_hash":"32d1a91b74351e3b95f4da32360db9eb78249f60747ef8e4f30017de440b31c5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}